"""Check world positions, generated by scripts/dump_check_coords.py.

Each entry is the game position the PopTracker pack pins a check at. Missions
carry their launcher's trigger position, collectibles their pickup position,
purchases their for-sale icon, stores their robbery trigger, and side events
their launcher. Emergency vehicle milestones have no position and stunt jumps
are exe-native, so neither class appears here.

Indexed classes are lists in check order (the order that fixes location ids and
names); the rest are keyed by check name.
"""

